title: Links and resources
description: "Official KoboldCpp links: GitHub releases and wiki, the SourceForge mirror, Hugging Face templates, Discord, KoboldAI Lite and related projects."
template: splash
---

## KoboldCpp

- [GitHub repository](https://github.com/LostRuins/koboldcpp): the source code and the README.
- [Releases](https://github.com/LostRuins/koboldcpp/releases/latest): the official downloads.
- [SourceForge mirror](https://sourceforge.net/projects/koboldcpp/): a mirror of the GitHub releases and repository.
- [GitHub wiki](https://github.com/LostRuins/koboldcpp/wiki): the project's own wiki and FAQ.
- [Report a bug](https://github.com/LostRuins/koboldcpp/issues) or [ask in Discussions](https://github.com/LostRuins/koboldcpp/discussions).
- [Docker image](https://hub.docker.com/r/koboldai/koboldcpp) and [Colab notebook](https://colab.research.google.com/github/LostRuins/koboldcpp/blob/concedo/colab.ipynb): run KoboldCpp on a server or on a Google cloud GPU.

## Models and templates

- [KoboldCpp on Hugging Face](https://huggingface.co/koboldcpp): newbie templates, and Whisper, TTS and image models.
- [Newbie templates](https://huggingface.co/koboldcpp/newbie-templates): the templates the launcher's **Get Help** loads.

## Community

- [KoboldAI Discord](https://koboldai.org/discord)
- [r/KoboldAI](https://www.reddit.com/r/KoboldAI/) on Reddit
- [GitHub Discussions](https://github.com/LostRuins/koboldcpp/discussions)

## Related

- [KoboldAI Lite online](https://lite.koboldai.net): the interface built into KoboldCpp, in your browser, for online AI services such as the AI Horde.
- [KoboldCpp API reference](https://lite.koboldai.net/koboldcpp_api)
- [AI Horde](https://aihorde.net): a volunteer network that shares AI models; KoboldCpp can join it as a worker.
- [llama.cpp](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp) and [stable-diffusion.cpp](https://github.com/leejet/stable-diffusion.cpp): the projects KoboldCpp builds on.
- [KoboldAI.com](https://koboldai.com): guides for the KoboldAI projects.
